---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import Link from "@components/Link.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me" description="About Angelo Zuffiano, Senior Machine Learning Researcher and AI enthusiast.">
  <Container>
    <aside data-pagefind-ignore>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h1 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            About Me
          </h1>
          <article class="space-y-4">
            <p>
              Hey there! 👋 I'm Angelo, a Senior Machine Learning Researcher who spends his days teaching computers to look at teeth.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <section class="animate space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            What I Do (Mostly)
          </h2>
          <article class="space-y-2">
            <p>Building AI for 3D dental imaging, and, previously, radiology diagnostics</p>
            <p>PyTorch/TensorFlow wizardry on computer vision and generative stuff</p>
            <p>Co-authored patents in AI for dentistry</p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="animate space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            Current Obsession
          </h2>
          <article class="space-y-2">
            <p>
              Messing with LLMs, multimodal AI, and whatever shiny new tool can make science (or side projects) go faster.
            </p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="animate space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            Beyond the Code
          </h2>
          <article class="space-y-2">
            <p>When not staring at models training:</p>
            <p>📚 Reading AI papers</p>
            <p>🔧 Building silly side projects: aDale.ink (AI personalized kids' books), Hirflow (nagging people about unpaid invoices), and random C code on old PCs (RetroLM)</p>
            <p>🎯 Wondering if AI will save the world or just make better cat videos</p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="animate space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            Philosophy
          </h2>
          <article class="space-y-2">
            <p class="italic">
              AI is at its best when it empowers people to achieve great things
            </p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="animate space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
            Let's Connect
          </h2>
          <article class="space-y-2">
            <p>
              Always up for chatting AI, healthcare hacks, and indie building.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-1 pt-2">
              <p>
                <Link href="https://github.com/agaz1985" external>
                  GitHub: @agaz1985
                </Link>
              </p>
              <p>
                <Link href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/angantzuff" external>
                  LinkedIn: /in/angantzuff
                </Link>
              </p>
              <p>
                <Link href="https://twitter.com/angzuff" external>
                  X (Twitter): @angzuff
                </Link>
              </p>
              <p>
                <Link href="https://medium.com/@angelo_zuffiano" external>
                  Medium: @angelo_zuffiano
                </Link>
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="animate space-y-2">
          <p class="text-sm">
            This site is my playground for AI rants, experiments, and occasional wins. Thanks for dropping by! 😄
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </Container>
</Layout>
